你沒有戀愛的感覺，希望我們可以繼續做朋友。」","n":35,"ssz":"....1.............................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].note","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"打岔型第 1 例原稿的下引號未閉合（「…買東西？ 後面沒有」），照原樣抄","n":36,"ssz":"...................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎你覺得哪種拒絕方式最讓人受傷？（勾選）","n":20,"ssz":"...1................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"為什麼呢？因為","n":7,"ssz":"1.....1"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].note","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"原稿是一條手寫底線","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎根據你上一題的答案，換個角度想想，你認為為什麼有人會用這種方式拒絕呢？（勾選，可複選）","n":44,"ssz":".....2......1........1......................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"怕尷尬，不知道怎麼面對氣氛","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"不知道怎麼說才合適","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].options.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"怕傷對方心情或破壞友情","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].options.4","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"希望時間自然解決，「拖一拖就好了」","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].options.5","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"其實也沒那麼在乎對方的感受","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].options.6","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"怕被對方糾纏、不想再被問","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].options.7","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"想保護自己，避免被嘲笑或遭到報復","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].options.8","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"習慣用玩笑或模糊話語逃避尷尬場合","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"三、學習新方法：在文章中，告白的人及被告白的人都展現了真誠與善意，也較接近我們的「一致型」應對姿態，而無論是在友情、愛情或任何關係，當想表達不同互動期待時，我們都可以參考以下原則，請同步將你已經會使用的原則打勾──","n":107,"ssz":".........................................1...1............................................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].columns[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"會用的打勾","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].columns[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"原則","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].columns[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"目的","n":2,"ssz":".2"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].rows[0][1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"誠實──坦白說出自己的感受與界線","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].rows[0][2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"誠實直接、避免誤會","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].rows[0][3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.「我有時候比較想自己一個人待著，不是你的問題。」\n2.「我對你沒有戀愛的感覺，還是想當朋友。」","n":49,"ssz":".............1....1.............................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].rows[0][3]#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.「我有時候比較想自己一個人待著，不是你的問題。」","n":26,"ssz":".............1....1......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].rows[0][3]#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.「我對你沒有戀愛的感覺，還是想當朋友。」","n":22,"ssz":"......................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].rows[1][1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"感謝──感謝對方的勇氣或付出","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].rows[1][2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"讓對方能感受到心意有被看見和珍惜。","n":17,"ssz":".............1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].rows[1][3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.「謝謝你總是願意陪我說心事。」\n2.「謝謝你願意坦白告訴我你的心意。」","n":37,"ssz":"....1.................1.............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].rows[1][3]#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.「謝謝你總是願意陪我說心事。」","n":17,"ssz":"....1............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].rows[1][3]#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.「謝謝你願意坦白告訴我你的心意。」","n":19,"ssz":"....1.............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].rows[2][1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"尊重──給對方情緒和回應的空間","n":15,"ssz":".........1.1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].rows[2][2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"尊重對方感受，讓對方自在表達情緒。","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].rows[2][3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.「如果你覺得不太舒服，可以先跟我說。」\n2.「如果你需要時間調整心情，我都可以理解。」","n":45,"ssz":".......11...................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].rows[2][3]#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.「如果你覺得不太舒服，可以先跟我說。」","n":21,"ssz":".......11............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].rows[2][3]#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.「如果你需要時間調整心情，我都可以理解。」","n":23,"ssz":"......................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].rows[3][1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"祝福──善意祝福並尊重選擇","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].rows[3][2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"讓關係自在、不強求。","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].rows[3][3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.「希望我們還能自在做朋友，但如果你想保持距離我也懂。」\n2.「你很好，也希望你遇到真正適合你的人。」","n":52,"ssz":"...................................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].rows[3][3]#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.「希望我們還能自在做朋友，但如果你想保持距離我也懂。」","n":29,"ssz":"............................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].rows[3][3]#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.「你很好，也希望你遇到真正適合你的人。」","n":22,"ssz":"......................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎小試身手","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"根據以上原則，底下回應，哪些是最符合「一致型」，展現善意與尊重的？","n":33,"ssz":"..........1........1............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「真的謝謝你對我的喜歡，但我現在的心情還沒準備好談感情。」","n":29,"ssz":"....1........................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「這個問題現在說再多也沒什麼幫助，先把作業做完吧。」","n":26,"ssz":"..1......................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].options.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「我沒有那麼好啦，我覺得你不要考慮我，希望你不要生氣。」","n":28,"ssz":"...........1.1........1....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].options.4","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「你為什麼要跟我說這個？不覺得這樣很尷尬嗎？」","n":23,"ssz":"..1.......1...1........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].options.5","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「我知道沒辦法回應你會讓你有點難過，如果你想談，我可以聽你說。」","n":32,"ssz":"........1......................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].options.6","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「哈哈哈，你別鬧了啦，趕快去跟別人聊一聊啦！」","n":23,"ssz":"......................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"紅色 ☑（圖形），文字流無此資訊","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[12].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎實戰練習","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[13].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"根據以下情境，練習以真誠、善意的方式回覆。","n":21,"ssz":"....................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[14].caption","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"手機聊天畫面截圖：對方（小魚）傳來的告白訊息","n":22,"ssz":"......................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[14].transcript","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"小魚\n今天\n想和你說，希望你不要嚇到 其實我一直很喜歡你，覺得和你聊天很開心，也覺得我們想法很像，不知道你有沒有可能也喜歡我？\n7:27 PM","n":71,"ssz":".......1......1.......2.......11.........1............................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[14].transcript#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"小魚","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[14].transcript#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"今天","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[14].transcript#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"想和你說，希望你不要嚇到 其實我一直很喜歡你，覺得和你聊天很開心，也覺得我們想法很像，不知道你有沒有可能也喜歡我？","n":57,"ssz":".1......1.......2.......11.........1...................